# Repository-wide ignores.
# The .NET-specific rules (bin/, obj/, .idea/) live in BarberSearch/.gitignore.

# ACL recovery artifacts written by the DSH sandbox repair on 2026-10-12.
# They hold the pre-repair permission backup and the rollback script for the workspace root.
# Pattern has no inner slash, so it matches at any depth. Keep the files until the workspace
# permission fix is confirmed stable, but never commit them.
acl-recovery/

# Local tool caches (created when the agent shell has to keep caches inside the workspace)
.npm-cache/
.nuget-packages/
.dotnet-home/

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.user
*.suo
.vs/

# .NET build output. BarberSearch/.gitignore covers only its own subtree, so the
# test project under backend/tests/ needs the rules at the repository root.
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
